// 5:3, five equal bars of 0.6. The image is 330 pixels high, so a unit is 110 pixels, and the V is
// placed from the image's center (270.5, 165 pixels), which is 2.5 and 1.5 here. The stroke is 0.04.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "V Pride Flag"
  designer "NonMonoPrideFlags (DeviantArt)"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  date "2015-12-27"
  source "https://web.archive.org/web/20220813051757/https://www.deviantart.com/nonmonoprideflags/art/V-Pride-Flag-580460334"
  note "NonMonoPrideFlags's DeviantArt post 'V Pride Flag', as the Wayback Machine held it on 13 August 2022, says: 'This is my pride flag design for a V relationship', a relationship of three people in which one is involved with two partners who aren't involved with each other. It gives the colors' meanings, red for passion, grey for stability and purple for sensuality, and no measurements or color values. The post is dated 27 December 2015 (UTC)."
  note "The post's image, the original file, is a JPEG of 541 by 330 pixels, 1.64:1, as are all this designer's flags of that month, so no deliberate proportion is clear. This file uses the common 5:3. The image draws five equal bars, of 65 or 66 pixels each."
  note "The colors are read from the image's pixels, which are flat in the bars: red #ef444c, grey #acacac and purple #c071c0. The V is a thin line, which the JPEG blurs, so its color is the median of its pixels, #a1d6e7. The same designer's T flag, from the same day, reads #9cd8e8 for its letter."
  note "The V is an approximation of the designer's hand-drawn letter, built from two straight strokes with a mitred point. Its ends and point are where the image has them, and its stroke is about 4.5 pixels, as the image's is. The designer's line has rounded ends, and its V sits a little toward the hoist of the center."
}
palette {
  red "#ef444c"
  grey "#acacac"
  purple "#c071c0"
  blue "#a1d6e7"
}
proportion hoist=3 fly=5

bars red grey purple grey red

charge polygon blue {
  point fly=1.699 hoist=0.756
  point fly=2.375 hoist=2.226
  point fly=3.009 hoist=0.756
  point fly=2.973 hoist=0.740
  point fly=2.373 hoist=2.128
  point fly=1.735 hoist=0.740
}
